+- `measureReal_maxLeEvent_frechet (hξ : 0 < ξ) (hF : ∀ i x, P.real (X i ⁻¹' Iic x) = frechetCDF ξ x) (x) :
+  P.real (maxLeEvent X x) = frechetCDF ξ ((Fintype.card ι : ℝ) ^ (-ξ) * x)` and
